WEBVTT

00:00:25.547 --> 00:00:26.160
<v><b>Izzy’s voicemail:</b></v> I’m sorry.

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:27.453
I can’t take your call at the moment.

00:00:27.641 --> 00:00:29.693
Please leave a message and I’ll get back to you.

00:00:30.713 --> 00:00:31.443
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Hi, Izzy.

00:00:32.234 --> 00:00:32.890
It’s Ben.

00:00:34.323 --> 00:00:35.583
Can you call me back, please?

00:00:54.328 --> 00:00:55.396
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Light on London.

00:00:55.719 --> 00:00:56.709
How can I help you?

00:00:57.589 --> 00:00:58.042
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Hi.

00:00:58.818 --> 00:01:01.589
Can I speak to Izzy Silva, please?

00:01:02.214 --> 00:01:04.308
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Just a second, I’ll put you through…

00:01:12.042 --> 00:01:12.490
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Izzy?

00:01:13.082 --> 00:01:15.615
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Sorry, she’s not at her desk right now.

00:01:16.198 --> 00:01:17.636
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Can I leave a message, please?

00:01:18.052 --> 00:01:18.635
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Sure.

00:01:19.359 --> 00:01:20.635
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Can you tell her Ben called?

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:22.547
I’ll call her back later.

00:01:23.818 --> 00:01:26.167
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> No problem, I’ll give her the message.

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:27.709
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Thanks.

00:01:48.714 --> 00:01:51.073
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Light on London, how can I help you?

00:01:51.719 --> 00:01:52.130
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Hi.

00:01:52.484 --> 00:01:54.604
Can I speak to Izzy Silva, please?

00:01:55.167 --> 00:02:03.969
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Just a second… I’m sorry, the line’s busy.

00:02:04.521 --> 00:02:05.333
Do you want to hold?

00:02:05.875 --> 00:02:06.480
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yes.

00:02:06.953 --> 00:02:07.562
I’ll hold.

00:02:18.188 --> 00:02:20.308
<v><b>Max:</b></v> Hello, Izzy Silva’s phone.

00:02:21.021 --> 00:02:23.886
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Uh…Is Izzy there?

00:02:25.182 --> 00:02:25.599
<v><b>Max:</b></v> Ben?

00:02:26.222 --> 00:02:29.354
Er, no. She’s taken the day off.

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:35.791
Er…I’d give her some space if I were you.

00:02:38.807 --> 00:02:39.911
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Thanks for the advice.